# (0.20) The PC volume on the Desktop (DESK=1; tests/mousegen.py makes tests/pcdesk.keys from
# this). emu816 --pc-folder on a fresh copy of tests/pc, --pc-time 2026-03-04T05:06 (the PC's
# clock), --pc-drop-at 27.5 --pc-back-at 35.5 (the link drops, then comes back). Files is at
# (24, 24); its rows from y 61, 12 apart. The PC icon is at (595, 160). Shots (s):
#   1   7.0  the PC icon under the Atari; the clock set from the PC (05:06)
#   2  16.0  BLUE.XEX and the docs folder dropped on the PC icon (copied into /PC:), then
#            a double click on the PC icon: Files at /PC:
#   3  17.0  Notes.txt selected in it: its date on the footer (then ctrl-C)
#   4  21.0  the first Files window raised, ctrl-V: Notes.txt copied from the PC to the card
#   5  26.0  README.TXT dragged from the card's window into the PC's: (0.27) copied (was: a copy, then
#            the card's file deleted)
#   6  33.5  the link dropped at 27.5 s: (0.31) the PC icon stays (it is always there); a
#            double click on it (30 s): the alert "The PC link is not connected."
#   7  41.5  the link back at 35.5 s: a double click on the PC icon (38 s) opens Files at
#            /PC: (the check: STAT /PC:, the clock set from the PC again)
#   8  48.5  Edit from the Programs menu, ctrl-O: the file dialog lists the card's root with
#            the PC: folder
#   9  51.5  "pc", Enter: the dialog in /PC:
